      <title>Graphic Design: Whiteface ASRC Logo</title>
      <link>https://jojudge.com/articles/gd-whiteface/</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;A quick overview of my logo design.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;div class="svelte-1mfdacw"&gt;&lt;span style="display: contents;--joeysvelte-general-gap-sm:8px;--joeysvelte-general-gap-md:16px;--joeysvelte-general-gap-lg:24px;--joeysvelte-overlay-backgroundColor:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);--joeysvelte-overlay-blur:16px;--joeysvelte-scrollbar-color:rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.5);--joeysvelte-text-colors-primary:black;--joeysvelte-text-colors-secondary:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);--joeysvelte-blockquote-backgroundColor:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0));--joeysvelte-blockquote-borderColor:#d0d0d0;--joeysvelte-textfield-backgroundColor:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);--joeysvelte-textfield-borderColor:#d0d0d0;--joeysvelte-link-colors-default:#f46400;--joeysvelte-link-colors-hover:brown;--joeysvelte-bg-backgroundColor:white;--joeysvelte-bg-backgroundImage:;--joeysvelte-bg-topLeft-text:start;--joeysvelte-bg-topLeft-color:rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.05);--joeysvelte-bg-bottomRight-color:rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.05);--joeysvelte-brand-colors-1:#ff568c;--joeysvelte-brand-colors-2:#f8a000;--joeysvelte-brand-colors-3:#4b6bcb;--joeysvelte-header-colors-1:#ff568c;--joeysvelte-header-colors-2:#f8a000;--joeysvelte-header-colors-3:#00863b;--joeysvelte-header-colors-4:#4b6bcb;--joeysvelte-header-colors-5:#cc0e9c;--joeysvelte-header-colors-6:#ce2929;--joeysvelte-item-folder-color:black;--joeysvelte-item-liveStream-colors-checking:orange;--joeysvelte-item-liveStream-colors-online:red;--joeysvelte-frame-background-color:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);--joeysvelte-frame-background-blur:8px;--joeysvelte-frame-border-width:1px;--joeysvelte-frame-border-color-default:#ccc;--joeysvelte-frame-border-color-focus:orange;--joeysvelte-action-colors-confirm:green;--joeysvelte-action-colors-warning:orange;--joeysvelte-action-colors-danger:red;--joeysvelte-clickable-colors-hover:#ffa50054;--joeysvelte-clickable-colors-active:#c882006e;--joeysvelte-code-colors-primary:black;--joeysvelte-code-colors-tag:black;--joeysvelte-code-colors-subst:black;--joeysvelte-code-colors-strong:black;--joeysvelte-code-colors-emphasis:black;--joeysvelte-code-colors-bullet:#5900ff;--joeysvelte-code-colors-quote:#5900ff;--joeysvelte-code-colors-number:#5900ff;--joeysvelte-code-colors-regexp:#5900ff;--joeysvelte-code-colors-literal:#5900ff;--joeysvelte-code-colors-link:#5900ff;--joeysvelte-code-colors-code:#537d00;--joeysvelte-code-colors-title:#537d00;--joeysvelte-code-colors-section:#537d00;--joeysvelte-code-colors-selectorClass:#537d00;--joeysvelte-code-colors-keyword:#b10041;--joeysvelte-code-colors-selectorTag:#b10041;--joeysvelte-code-colors-name:#b10041;--joeysvelte-code-colors-attr:#b10041;--joeysvelte-code-colors-symbol:#007a92;--joeysvelte-code-colors-attribute:#007a92;--joeysvelte-code-colors-params:black;--joeysvelte-code-colors-class:black;--joeysvelte-code-colors-string:#a56100;--joeysvelte-code-colors-type:#a56100;--joeysvelte-code-colors-built_in:#a56100;--joeysvelte-code-colors-selectorId:#a56100;--joeysvelte-code-colors-selectorAttr:#a56100;--joeysvelte-code-colors-selectorPseudo:#a56100;--joeysvelte-code-colors-addition:#a56100;--joeysvelte-code-colors-variable:#a56100;--joeysvelte-code-colors-templateVariable:#a56100;--joeysvelte-code-colors-comment:#6f6f6f;--joeysvelte-code-colors-deletion:#6f6f6f;--joeysvelte-code-colors-meta:#aaaaaa" class="svelte-sg7uwc"&gt;&lt;div style="overflow: visible; padding: 16px; min-width: 0px;" class="svelte-1fm7rv2"&gt;&lt;figure style="--item-min-width:300px" class="svelte-1i279vc figure-original has-frame"&gt;&lt;div class="contents svelte-1i279vc"&gt;&lt;div class="img-container svelte-qjwe13" style="--img-max-height:450px;--img-width:undefined;--img-height:undefined;--img-h-align:center"&gt;&lt;img class="img clickable svelte-qjwe13" src="https://jojudge.com/_app/immutable/assets/logo.BtnG8OVO.svg" alt=" " style=""&gt;&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="caption svelte-1i279vc"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;The Whiteface ASRC logo was designed seperately from the SUNY Albany ASRC logo in order to give the Whiteface ASRC a more distinct identity without tampering with the historical background of the original ASRC logo. The logo is modeled after the shape of the round-house and silo at the top of the mountain while also including key elements such as the shape of the mountain, the silhouette of the cloud collector, and the radio platform.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;figure style="--item-min-width:300px" class="svelte-1i279vc figure-original"&gt;&lt;div class="contents svelte-1i279vc"&gt;&lt;div class="img-container svelte-qjwe13" style="--img-max-height:450px;--img-width:undefined;--img-height:undefined;--img-h-align:center"&gt;&lt;img class="img clickable" alt=" " loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1000" height="650" src="https://jojudge.com/_app/immutable/assets/photo.DF-O7WCe.jpeg" style="background: url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRkAAAABXRUJQVlA4IDQAAACwAQCdASoQAAoABUB8JaACdACqg9+AAPpgxyJpLb60sjNOykptkurmWeX1F3nYw2xb1EAA) no-repeat center/cover;"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="caption svelte-1i279vc"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;p&gt;The font used is Josefin Sans and was mainly chosen due to its bold look and the distinct shape of its W. The logo was designed in Inkscape.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
